### Secrets — PHAI dung dau tien ###
# Cac duong dan duoi day tung chua credential that tren nhanh nay.
# Khong xoa chung khi nhap bo starter moi.
#
#   config/   - application-*.yml, supabase.env, vm_key (private SSH key)
#   .env      - DB_PASSWORD cua docker compose
#
/config/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
!**/*.key.example

### Build output ###
# target/ va logs/ la artifact cuc bo con sot tu ung dung truoc day.
target/
build/
dist/
logs/
coverage/
.next/
out/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo

### Node ###
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
.pnpm-store/
*.log

### Next.js ###
# next-env.d.ts duoc Next sinh lai moi lan build.
next-env.d.ts
.vercel

### Prisma ###
# Client sinh ra tu `prisma generate` (Prisma 7 dat vao src/). Sinh lai duoc,
# khong commit. CI/Docker phai chay `prisma generate` truoc khi build.
apps/api/src/generated/

### IDE ###
.idea
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

### Kiro ###
# mcp.json chua connection string kem password, khong commit.
.kiro/settings/mcp.json
